 Controle rigoroso de receitas e despesas. Visão clara da saúde financeira do estúdio <span class="text-orange-500 font-bold">Malha3D</span>.
 </p>
 </div>
 <div class="flex items-center gap-3 flex-wrap shrink-0">
 <button class="w-14 h-14 sm:w-16 sm:h-16 shrink-0 rounded-[5px] bg-emerald-500/10 hover:bg-emerald-500/20 border border-emerald-500/20 hover:border-emerald-500/50 text-emerald-400 font-bold transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-1.5 hover:shadow-emerald-500/10 cursor-pointer" data-bs-toggle="modal" data-bs-target="#newTransactionModal" onclick="setModalType('receita')">
